<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - XLConnect started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - XLConnect started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities said it started coverage of XLConnect Solutions Inc with a hold based on valuation.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 3/8 to 28-1/2.</p>
